      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KRIS BAR IMOGEN (2) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 7th at Shepparton following on from a third place finish (25.50) there the start prior. Was a winner at her only start from this draw. Should bounce back. TIGER ROCKS (5) was a little disappointing last start at The Meadows when 4th (30.85) over 525m. Has won here at this journey. Has the ability to give this a shake. MISS SOOKY (8) took the sit on the lead from an outside box but levelled up and drew clear to score (26.72) at Warragul in Grade 5 over 460m. Hard to fault her form and she makes plenty of appeal. WANGARATTA GIRL (4) is new to this course but should be in the mix.",
